      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlottetown"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Charlottetown once dominated the province’s railway network, but CN Rail’s 1989 withdrawal turned former tracks into waterfront parks.",
